Access Key

Secret Key
2. IAM Group

A Group is a collection of users with the same permissions.

Instead of assigning permissions individually:

Alice
Bob
Charlie

Create:

Developers Group

Attach one policy:

Developers

↓

AmazonS3ReadOnly

Every member automatically receives those permissions.

Benefits
Easier administration
Consistent permissions
